Rust verifies run inside the worktree as `CARGO_TARGET_DIR="$TARGET" cargo <verify args>`.
Read AGENTS.md. Keep the supplied base fixed: never rebase or merge, per AGENTS.md's
unit exception. Cap terminal output.
